sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Operator
    participant F as Verified source bundle
    participant L as Serial loader
    participant D as Compact database
    participant P as Selection processing
    U->>L: Initialize fresh 0.0.4 national source
    L->>F: Verify manifests, closure, hashes and row counts
    loop File and record-position work
        L->>F: Read at most 8192 rows / 64 MiB
        L->>D: COPY or staged merge; facts and compact locators
        L->>D: Commit data and checkpoint atomically
    end
    L->>D: Aggregate municipality assertions; finalize
    L->>D: Reconcile counts, build secondary indexes, validate, analyze
    D-->>U: Source completion gate
    U->>P: Process Uddevalla from database
    P->>D: Complete cohorts, certificates, evidence and decisions
    P-->>U: Baseline, reports and export acceptance gate
    Note over U,P: National publication is a separate gate. Height blockers remain explicit.
